The collection_init function initializes the Collection, handling potential memory allocation failures gracefully. The collection_get_record function dynamically allocates more memory if necessary to prevent memory fragmentation.

The collection_add, collection_update, and collection_find functions allow adding, updating, and finding records in the collection. The collection_serialize and collection_deserialize functions serialize and deserialize the entire collection to/from a file.']

