The code also includes iterators for forward and backward traversals of the linked list, as well as a mechanism for caching frequently accessed records to improve lookup times. However, cache eviction policy is not implemented in this example. Additionally, memory management, logging, large dataset optimization, and various trade-offs mentioned are not considered here but can be added based on specific requirements and constraints.']

