The `list_log_events()` function iterates through the list, logs each event using an external logging library (assuming it has been implemented), and frees the payload and node memory. The memory monitoring strategy can be defined in the `list_monitor_memory()` function.

Finally, the `list_free()` function deallocates all resources when the list is no longer needed. This code should serve as a starting point for further development, including implementation of additional features such as advanced filtering and aggregation capabilities while maintaining thread safety, backward compatibility, and minimizing code duplication."]

